What is Rotating Savings and Credit (ROSCA) Digital App?
Rotating Savings and Credit (ROSCA) digital apps are innovative platforms that modernize traditional informal savings groups, allowing members to pool funds periodically and receive rotating lump-sum payouts. These apps streamline group formation, secure transactions, and transparency through digital tools, covering processes like member onboarding, automated collections, payout scheduling, default management, and reporting. Core features include mobile wallets, real-time dashboards, SMS notifications, and integration with payment systems.
